      "message": "We have some requirements to set some flag in the boot time. Our solution, ICD has used get_cmdline() but we should change ICD to LKM (Loadable Kernel Module) so we cannot use get_cmdline() anymore. Because get_cmdline() is not EXPORT_SYMBOL. And so we decided to implement get_cmdline() into our source code internally.\nWe just copied original get_cmdline() from Kernel core source and pasted.\nIt uses access_process_vm() and so we added the symbol into this list.\nWe need get_cmdline() to get argument of system daemon from kernel over task_struct.\n\ncf. If you know to replace using get_cmdline(), please let us know.",
